    "posts": [
      {
        "id": 13739,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-10-10T05:46:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My family was just playing our first ever game (I'd done a few solos, but this was their first game, and my first multiplayer), and I am particularly proud of our victory.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Vital Strength of the Earth gave a Gift of Strength to Lightning's Swift Strike, which fueled Lightning's Powerstorm to monsterous proportions. &nbsp;The Powerstorm, along with Lightning's Boon gave Shadows Flicker Like Flames the speed and power required for the Jungle to Hunger and swallow the three remaining cities simultaneously. &nbsp;This (understandably) terrified the invaders, who reached terror level 3 and fled the island screaming, leaving their abandoned towns behind them.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Anyone else have any unsually interesting victories yet?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:38.114Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
