        "raw": "<p>My family was just playing our first ever game (I&#39;d done a few solos, but this was their first game, and my first multiplayer), and I am particularly proud of our victory.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Vital Strength of the Earth gave a Gift of Strength to Lightning&#39;s Swift Strike, which fueled Lightning&#39;s Powerstorm to monsterous proportions. &nbsp;The Powerstorm, along with Lightning&#39;s Boon gave Shadows Flicker Like Flames the speed and power required for the Jungle to Hunger and swallow the three remaining cities simultaneously. &nbsp;This (understandably) terrified the invaders, who reached terror level 3 and fled the island screaming, leaving their abandoned towns behind them.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Anyone else have any unsually interesting victories yet?</p>",
